ot leak into recurring sources\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a recurring source that is genuinely stale is never rescued by this path\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a never-run manual connector does not get CollectionSucceeded=true from source-kind alone\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a never-run manual connector still reports Fresh as not_applicable (freshness and completion are independent)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a manual connector with a real successful-import receipt gets CollectionSucceeded=true\"}}\n\n==> test/connection-id-request.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"clampRecordsPageLimit falls back to default for absent / unparseable / non-positive\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"clampRecordsPageLimit passes through an in-range limit unclamped\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"clampRecordsPageLimit clamps an over-max limit and flags it\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"clampRecordsPageLimit parses numeric strings\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"buildLimitClampedWarning carries stable code, param, and detail\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"validateConnectionAlias throws only on conflicting canonical vs alias\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"validateConnectionAlias is a no-op when they match or only one is set\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"resolveRequestConnectionId prefers canonical and emits alias warning when alias present\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"resolveRequestConnectionId returns canonical with no warning when alias absent\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"resolveRequestConnectionId returns alias value + warning when only alias set\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"resolveRequestConnectionId returns null identity when neither set\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"resolveRequestConnectionId throws on conflicting values (delegates to validator)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"projectStorageDisplayName drops non-strings, blanks, and placeholders\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"projectStorageDisplayName drops names equal to the connector id or instance id\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"projectStorageDisplayName returns a trimmed owner-meaningful label\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing is a no-op when no connection identity supplied\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing throws connection_not_found on mismatch\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing throws when the grant has no addressable binding\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing passes when identity matches the binding\"}}\n\n==> test/connection-health-source-pressure-backlog.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: null/absent evidence yields a null rollup\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: unreadable store yields null, not a fabricated zero\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: readable-but-drained is a real 0, distinct from null\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: pending counts only source-pressure gaps\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: only non-source-pressure gaps reports 0 pending\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: max_attempt_count is the max across source-pressure gaps\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: next_attempt_at is the latest gap-authored floor\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: next_attempt_at is null when no gap authored a floor\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: pending is a floor when the bounded read hits its limit\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: pending can be a zero floor when a full mixed-reason page has no pressure gaps\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: pending is exact when the read did not hit the bound\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: an empty backlog is never a floor even with a bound\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: pending is exact when no read bound is supplied\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: recovered is null when not computed and passed through when present\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"backlog: pending is never inferred from record counts (no record input exists)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"snapshot: exposes detail_gap_backlog derived from the evidence\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"snapshot: detail_gap_backlog is null when no evidence is supplied\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"snapshot: detail_gap_backlog is null when the gap store is unreadable\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"snapshot: backlog rollup does not move the headline projection\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"snapshot: a drained backlog (real 0) also leaves the headline untouched\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"snapshot: backlog carries only counts + an optional ISO timestamp (no secrets)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"snapshot: manual-refresh connector still exposes the backlog\"}}\n\n==> test/connection-narrowing-and-clamp-warning.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing: no connection identity in the request is a no-op\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing: canonical connection_id equal to the bound id passes\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing: deprecated connector_instance_id alias equal to bound id passes\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing: connection_id that does NOT match the bound id is connection_not_found\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing: a requested connection with NO bound storage is connection_not_found\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"enforceConnectionNarrowing: conflicting connection_id/alias is rejected before narrowing (invalid_argument)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"buildLimitClampedWarning: structured detail carries requested + max limit\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"buildLimitClampedWarning: preserves the exact requested value it is given\"}}\n\n==> test/connection-health.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unknown: any unreliable required projection forces unknown and names the source\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unknown: repeated projection reasons are canonicalized in first-seen order\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unknown: a generation-fenced terminal fold does not tell the owner to wait\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unknown: an genuinely transient projection source still says wait\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unknown: a mixed source set keeps wait when any source is transient\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unknown: superseded and catching-up projections carry different reasons and different remedies\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"shared condition reasons expose canonical reason-code constants\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unknown: takes precedence even over open attention\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"idle: owner-paused schedule wins over later evidence\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"idle: never-run connection with enabled schedule\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"needs_attention: open required attention beats backoff\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"needs_attention: open required attention beats never-run idle\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"needs_attention: attention does NOT override projection-unreliable\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"blocked: consecutiveFailures at threshold promotes cooling_off to blocked\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"blocked: current credential rejection is readiness evidence without waiting for backoff\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"credential: no usable stored credential projects credential_required, not rejected\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"credential: a rejected stored credential projects credential_rejected\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"credential: never-run connection with no stored credential still projects credential_required\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"credential: repair state does not heal by age — rejection persists after the run reason ages out\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"credential: absent credential evidence preserves prior run-reason-derived behavior\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: no usable stored credential projects the stored_credential surface\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: a rejected stored credential projects the stored_credential surface\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: a free-form session_required reason cannot authorize browser-session repair\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: an exact verified provider proof remains a monotonic one-repair authorization\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: structured attention remains the owner-action authority\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: browser capability routes session_required without a live remote surface\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: session_required yields to stored_credential when durable evidence says the credential was rejected\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: applicable static-secret absence wins before browser-session repair\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: browser-session repair remains available when stored-credential absence is not applicable\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: a non-browser connection with no usable credential routes session_required to stored_credential\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: browser-incapable session_required does not invent a credential rejection\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: active unrejected credentials do not turn non-definitive auth text into rejection\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"conditions: credential diagnostics redact token-shaped source details\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded: failed collection outranks sub-threshold backoff\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded: partial and stale evidence also outrank active backoff\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unknown: active backoff without affirmative coverage/freshness evidence is not passive cooling\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"cooling_off: source-pressure cooldown surfaces reason_code source_pressure (no failures)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"cooling_off: expired retry backoff is not current blocking evidence\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded: outbox stalled forces degraded even when run succeeded\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded: succeeded-with-gaps does not project as healthy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded: failed last run with no backoff applied yet\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded: coverage gaps without a failed run still degrade\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded: retryable_gap coverage axis degrades a succeeded run\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"retryable_gap coverage remediation is owner-actionable, not a passive wait\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded: terminal_gap coverage axis degrades a succeeded run\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"healthy is impossible when coverage axis is retryable_gap or terminal_gap\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"terminal_gap coverage becomes satisfied when every outstanding gap is durably accounted for as unfillable\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ANTI-FALSE-GREEN: a terminal_gap without unfillableAccounted stays blocked (unknown coverage is never rescued)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ANTI-FALSE-GREEN: unfillableAccounted is ignored (never a bypass) when the manifest is contradictory\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ANTI-FALSE-GREEN: unfillableAccounted has no effect on axes other than terminal_gap\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"accepted-coverage axes (unsupported/unavailable/deferred/inventory_only) can project healthy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"requiredButAccepted blocks healthy even when the axis is accepted-coverage\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"healthy: success + complete coverage + fresh + no attention/backoff\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local-device verdict: no run + verdict + complete coverage + fresh + idle → healthy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local-device verdict: absent verdict (no run) is not healthy — the verdict is what flips it\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local-device progress: active outbox with fresh complete evidence is syncing idle, not unknown\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local-device verdict: no refresh policy (freshness unknown) without verdict stays idle, not unknown\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local-device verdict: a real run verdict is authoritative over the device verdict\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local-device verdict: a stalled outbox still degrades even if a verdict is passed\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"conditions: remote-surface failure becomes runtime availability evidence\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"conditions: missing runtime binding is a blocked readiness condition\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"conditions: local exporter availability is separate from backlog state\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"healthy: complete coverage and fresh evidence can project healthy without outbox evidence\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"stale: schedulable connector stale alone surfaces as axis+badge and degrades\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"manual stale: background-unsafe complete+succeeded+stale is idle advisory, not degraded\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"manual stale: recommended_mode manual alone (background_safe null) is enough to advisory\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"manual stale: recommended_mode paused alone (background_safe null) is enough to advisory\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"manual stale: background_safe false alone (mode null) is enough to advisory\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"manual stale: a local-device collection verdict also satisfies the advisory\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"manual stale: schedulable connector with the SAME stale evidence still degrades\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"manual stale: incomplete coverage still degrades a manual connector\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"manual stale: terminal-gap coverage still degrades a manual connector\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"t