ted connector that is stale stays idle (not advisory-reclassified)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"activity: active work surfaces as syncing badge without replacing health pill\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"activity: syncing badge sits orthogonal to degraded headline\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"mixed: succeeded run with unknown coverage and unknown freshness falls back to unknown\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"mixed: succeeded run with complete coverage but unknown freshness is not healthy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"mixed: stale projection evidence reported as unknown when projection source flagged\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"axes: rolled up consistently across all headline states\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: trusted healthy heartbeat with zero pending is idle\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: fresh healthy or stopped heartbeat without pending evidence is unknown\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: trusted healthy heartbeat with pending work is active\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: starting/retrying heartbeats are active\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: stale starting/retrying heartbeats degrade to stalled, not stuck active forever\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: fresh starting/retrying heartbeats with no pending work stay active (real pending work is not hidden)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: blocked status with no dead letters is a state-read stall\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: blocked status with a small open backlog, zero dead letters, zero pending, and a fresh heartbeat is idle (bounded-debris carve-out)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: blocked status with backlog at the tolerance boundary is still idle, one past it is state_read_failed\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: a small open backlog does NOT get the debris carve-out when pending work is real\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: a small open backlog does NOT get the debris carve-out when the heartbeat is stale\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: the Signal/peregrine shape blames the stopped collector, not a server read failure\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: a FRESH blocked heartbeat still reads state_read_failed\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: unknown-magnitude backlog (field absent) does NOT get the debris carve-out — conservative default\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: blocked status with dead letters is a dead-letter backlog\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: blocked status with complete transient 5xx summary is system-handled\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: mixed or incomplete dead-letter summaries remain owner-recoverable\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: pending work + stale heartbeat degrades to stale_pending stall\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: fresh heartbeat with a fresh retrying backlog stays active (no false-red)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: fresh heartbeat with an old ACTUALLY-RETRIED backlog is stalled/transient_upload_failure, not active forever\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: an old NEVER-FAILED pending backlog stays active — age alone is not failure evidence\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: fresh heartbeat with an old actually-retried PENDING (not retrying-status) backlog also stalls\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: missing oldestRetryingAt never triggers the backlog-age stall (fails conservatively)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: malformed oldestRetryingAt never triggers the backlog-age stall (fails conservatively)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: old actually-retried backlog with zero pending never stalls (age check requires pending > 0)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"outbox axis: an old actually-retried backlog that later recovers (drains) returns active/idle, not stuck stalled\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local exporter: state_read_failed renders re-run copy, not generic stalled\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local exporter: dead_letter_backlog renders owner-readable failed-upload copy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local exporter: transient_upload_failure is degraded but system-handled\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"end-to-end: an old-but-fresh-heartbeat ACTUALLY-RETRIED backlog projects as degraded/system-handled, not stuck-active-forever\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"end-to-end: a genuinely live fresh retrying backlog projects as healthy, not a false-red degrade\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"end-to-end: an old but NEVER-FAILED backlog (large healthy first drain) projects as healthy, not a false-red degrade\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"end-to-end: recovery after the backlog drains returns to green, not latched degraded\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local exporter: stale_pending names the stopped heartbeat, not a backlog\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local exporter: stale_heartbeat names the stopped starting/retrying check-in\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"local exporter: stalled with no cause falls back to generic copy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"n