 with all required top-level fields\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: fresh healthy connection → green pill + calm channel\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: outbox unknown does not downgrade an otherwise complete non-outbox connector\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: active local-device outbox renders Syncing without owner action\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: a required stream with unresolved (unknown) coverage keeps its worst-wins vote — never masked green by a complete connection axis\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: latest-run partial sample rows do not override connection-level complete coverage\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: stale manual-refresh connection → amber/Needs refresh pill + advisory refresh action, not Healthy or Degraded\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: degraded retryable with resumable disposition → non-green pill + advisory Retry now\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: no terminal run but one current stream gap is coherent retryable advisory\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: timed-out manual action is retryable owner work, not connector-code work\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: toGrantScopedVerdict strips detail and trace\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: runtime_ok=false caps channel at calm regardless of snapshot state\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: per-stream rollup is present on the verdict streams array\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"owner-wire: synthesizer clamps collected to considered (impossible 3/2 cannot escape)\"}}\n\n==> test/owner-state.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ownerStateCausalEvidenceFrom: a succeeded classifying run is observed evidence, not frozen\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ownerStateCausalEvidenceFrom: a non-succeeded (real terminal failure) classifying run is frozen evidence\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ownerStateCausalEvidenceFrom: owner-cancel WITH prior success — caller substitutes the success, never the cancellation, in as the classifying run\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ownerStateCausalEvidenceFrom: owner-cancel with NO prior success — caller passes null (no classifying run), never the cancellation itself\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ownerStateCausalEvidenceFrom: no classifying run but a freshness proof exists falls back to observed evidence\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ownerStateCausalEvidenceFrom: no classifying run and no freshness proof has no evidence at all — never fabricated\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"scheduleModeFrom: null (no schedule row) is manual\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"scheduleModeFrom: a schedule row reads its own enabled flag as active/disabled\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: Chase-shaped — retryable gap resolves to system_degraded, system-owned, frozen\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: USAA-shaped — credential-rejected resolves to needs_owner, owner-owned, frozen\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: owner-paused (prior success, automatic schedule disabled) resolves to owner_paused, owner-owned, observed\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: a connector with no schedule row (manual) never resolves owner_paused\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: an enabled schedule row stays scheduled-active — never owner_paused — even when effective_mode would read paused\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: explicit revoked lifecycle resolves to retired, maintainer-owned, regardless of health shape\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: no lifecycle evidence never resolves retired, even for a terminal code_fix verdict\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: draft lifecycle (pending connection discovery) resolves to setup_in_progress, owner-owned, observed, regardless of health shape\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: no lifecycle evidence never resolves setup_in_progress, even for a never-run connection\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: draft + active run + no open attention resolves collecting (run.started-only window), never setup_in_progress\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: draft + active run + open OTP attention resolves needs_owner with the exact action, not the generic draft copy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: draft + no active run + no attention still resolves the generic setup_in_progress (nothing else to say yet)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: never-run (idle, no prior success) resolves to healthy, system-owned, observed\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: no evidence at all (never-run, no freshness proof, no active work) resolves not_measured with a null evidence_as_of, never green or fabricated\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: no evidence at all BUT an active run in progress resolves collecting, not not_measured\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: healthy fixture resolves to healthy, system-owned, observed\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: an active run resolves collecting even on a grey (unmeasured) tone, never not_measured\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: paused schedule + credential failure resolves needs_owner, not owner_paused (reauth must not be masked)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: paused schedule + terminal code_fix defect resolves blocked_maintainer, not owner_paused (code_fix must not be masked)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\