jects the data sub-object, preserving envelope siblings\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"projectRecordEnvelope: a record without a data object is projected directly\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"projectRecordEnvelope: no / empty fields returns the record unchanged\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"projectRecordEnvelope: a requested field absent from data simply does not appear (no undefined key)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"projectRecordEnvelope: an array-valued data is NOT treated as a projectable object\"}}\n\n==> test/read-projection.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"normalizeProjectionFields: array input trims, drops empties, de-dupes preserving order\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"normalizeProjectionFields: comma-string input is split, trimmed, de-duped\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"normalizeProjectionFields: array entries that themselves contain commas are re-split\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"normalizeProjectionFields: empty / whitespace / undefined => null sentinel (NOT [])\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"normalizeProjectionFields: single surviving field returns a one-element array, not null\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"projectRecordEnvelope: null/empty fields is identity and returns the SAME reference\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\