cts a record whose range field is uncoercible\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesTimeRange enforces an inclusive since and an exclusive until\"}}\n\n==> test/record-filters-fingerprint-plan.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"fingerprintDeclaredFields: dedupes, SORTS, and is insertion-order independent\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"compileSingleStreamSearchFilter: null-guards on stream name / manifest / grant\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"hashSearchPlanSummary: canonical, order-independent across connectors/streams/fields\"}}\n\n==> test/record-filters-predicates.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"nonNullSchemaTypes: strips null, handles scalar/array/absent type\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"parseDateValue: parses ISO strings, rejects non-strings/blank/garbage\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"coerceComparableValue: non-strict returns null on bad input; strict throws typed errors\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: empty/absent filters pass; exact match uses String() equality\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: range operator boundaries are gte-inclusive / gt-exclusive / lte-inclusive / lt-exclusive\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesTimeRange: no-op without range/field; since inclusive, until exclusive; bad date fails\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesGrantRecordConstraints: resources allowlist gates by record key, then time range\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"hasGrantRecordConstraints / needsCandidateRecordScan: detect time_constraint, resources, or filters\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"jsonPathForTopLevelField: quotes the field and escapes backslash then double-quote\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"allowedCandidateRecordKeysFromRows: skips unparseable JSON, applies grant + filters\"}}\n\n==> test/record-filters-runtime-evaluation.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: exact filter compares via String() coercion\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: exact filter coerces numeric record value to string\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: empty/absent filter list passes everything\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: gte is INCLUSIVE at the boundary\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: gt is EXCLUSIVE at the boundary\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: lte is INCLUSIVE at the boundary\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: lt is EXCLUSIVE at the boundary\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: combined half-open window [gte, lt)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesRequestFilters: null/uncoercible record value fails any range filter\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesTimeRange: no timeRange or no field name is a pass-through\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesTimeRange: since is INCLUSIVE, until is EXCLUSIVE (half-open)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesTimeRange: missing or unparseable field value is rejected\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesGrantRecordConstraints: resource allow-list gates by record key\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesGrantRecordConstraints: empty resources means no key restriction\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"passesGrantRecordConstraints: enforces the frozen grant time_constraint field\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"time_constraint is since-inclusive, until-exclusive, and fails closed\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"time_constraint preserves arbitrary literal top-level fields\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"hasGrantRecordConstraints: true only when time_constraint or non-empty resources\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"needsCandidateRecordScan: true when filters present OR grant constrains records\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"allowedCandidateRecordKeysFrom