ParamsForChangesFeed uses plural grammar for multiple params\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"validateCanonicalSort returns null for absent sort\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"validateCanonicalSort maps sign prefix to direction on the cursor field\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"validateCanonicalSort rejects non-cursor fields as invalid_sort\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"validateCanonicalSort rejects empty field and conflicting directions\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"parsePageOrder defaults to DESC and maps asc/desc\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"resolveListOrder prefers canonical sort direction\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"resolveListOrder rejects sort/order disagreement\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"resolveListOrder falls back to order when no sort\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"encodeKey / decodeKey round-trip strings and compound arrays\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"decorateRecordWithConnectionIdentity sets both id fields from a trimmed connectionId\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"decorateRecordWithConnectionIdentity omits blank identity and display name\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"attachRequestWarningsToResponse appends and preserves existing meta\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCO