g credentials are owner-repairable reauth, not maintainer code_fix\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: reauth carries the stored_credential surface from the credential condition\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: reauth carries the browser_session surface for a session-required failure\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: a browser_session reauth is satisfied by a confirming run, NOT a stored credential\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: a browser_session reauth never routes to stored-credential capture (no provider-page password path)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"surface: reauth falls back to stored_credential when the condition carries no surface\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: stalled outbox state-read block asks for re-run, not dead-letter retry\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"freshness: stalled local-device outbox with prior ingest evidence names the last known collection, not a false never-measured claim\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"freshness: local-device outbox with no prior ingest evidence keeps the honest never-measured copy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: dead-letter stalled outbox includes recover preview before apply\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"dead-letter summary bounds the magnitude with thousands separators\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"dead-letter summary pluralizes a multi-record backlog\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"dead-letter summary reads 'record' in the singular when the total is one\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"dead-letter summary falls back to the uncounted sentence when counts are unavailable\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: structured attention carries the exact sync target from its own run id\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: fallback add_info guidance stays plain text when no exact sync target exists\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: transient upload failures do not ask the owner to recover local uploads\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: stale-pending stalled outbox asks for collector re-run only\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: unknown stalled outbox diagnostics target source-instance recovery scope\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: degraded resumable stale coverage is advisory Retry now, not calm wait\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: failed deferred history is retryable, not a passive collecting wait\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: idle assisted retryable gap offers retry instead of passive collecting wait\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: a retryable gap whose only contributing stream is retry_by_runtime does not offer Retry now\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: retry_by_runtime without an active schedule still offers Retry now\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: MUTATION-SAFETY a genuinely owner-actionable retryable gap still offers Retry now\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: an unknown/absent recovery_action fails open and still offers Retry now\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: explicit manual-default background-safe schedule stays scheduled and does not offer Retry now\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: background-unsafe active schedule stays manual and still offers Retry now\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: paused active schedule stays manual and still offers Retry now\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"channel: source-pressure deferred recovery is a self-handled wait, not an owner Retry now action\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"forward_statement: terminal never claims resumed collection (inv3)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"progress: deferred connector never shows a structurally-zero records_emitted\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"progress: scheduled privileges records committed\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"progress: idle scheduled eligibility (no active run, no committed run) does not claim active collecting\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"needs-human scheduled source names the owner action instead of a refresh that cannot run\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"progress: an active scheduled run does say collecting\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"progress: terminal manual source never says refresh to update\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"composite: all eleven invariants hold across representative snapshots\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"property: tone is worst-wins (never below base state) and (tone,channel) orthogonal\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"action: terminal flag agrees with the disposition oracle (5.2)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"action: a connection needing both refresh and reauth renders two ordered actions (5.5)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"action: self-handled drain is a single calm wait action (5.4)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"action: every satisfied_when variant is one of the unified contract kinds (5.3)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"trace: explains tone cause, channel cause, suppressed evidence, and contract\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: ChatGPT — green/calm/fresh, no 2532 on dashboard, 2532 present in detail\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: Amazon/Reddit stale manual — amber/advisory/Needs refresh, not Healthy or Degraded\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"stale manual owner refresh survives optional checking streams, amber/Needs refresh not Healthy/Degraded\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"idle owner-paused with fresh data (no stale evidence yet) is amber/Needs refresh once a prior success exists\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: Acme Slack-shaped paused schedule + stale freshness + cancelled last run is amber/Needs refresh, not Healthy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: Chase-shaped resumable retryable gap stays Degraded, not Needs refresh\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: USAA-shaped awaiting_owner attention-open gap stays Degraded, not Needs refresh\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: terminal coverage stays Can't collect, not Needs refresh\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"degraded state (real degrading condition) with only stale freshness, no coverage/attention/outbox axis, still stays Degraded\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"idle never-run (no prior success, no stale evidence) stays neutral, not amber\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"idle never-run with fresh evidence (no prior terminal run yet) stays green, not amber\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: Chase — degraded/advisory with a retryable transactions gap\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: Amazon order_items stream name does not trip calm/advisory count invariant\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: broken but recently successful source says last successful refresh, not Fresh yesterday\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: stream-level terminal gap overrides healthy-state freshness copy\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: synthetic terminal code_fix — maintainer status, no dead owner button, never attention\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: succeeded terminal coverage reads as degraded coverage review, not total collection failure\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"golden: synthetic runtime fault — channel capped at calm, pill stays honest\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"refresh-contract: a zero-credential active account (ChatGPT-shape) is a valid green verdict\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"gate: throws (in dev) when a stream violates collected<=considered after a forced bad row\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"grant-scope: toGrantScopedVerdict strips detail and trace\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"reattach_schedule: an owner-paused source with prior success emits it as primary, and every derived field agrees\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"reattach_schedule: never emitted for a never-run source, even with a disabled schedule\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"reattach_schedule: never emitted for an active (non-disabled) schedule\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"reattach_schedule: never emitted for a manual connector (no schedule concept applies)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"reattach_schedule: omitting scheduleEvidence entirely is byte-identical to passing null (existing callers unaffected)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"reattach_schedule: paused schedule + credential failure — reauth stays primary, reattach_schedule does not fire at all\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"reattach_schedule: paused schedule + terminal code_fix defect — code_fix stays primary, reattach_schedule never fires\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"reattach_schedule: paused schedule preempts refresh_now — a merely-stale paused source gets Resume schedule, not a one-off refresh\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"refresh_now: background-unsafe active schedule stays manual and keeps the owner refresh action\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"refresh_now: paused active schedule stays manual and keeps the owner refresh action\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"unfillable-accounted: an all-proven terminal_gap stream renders non-red with no maintainer code_fix\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ANTI-FALSE-GREEN: one unproven terminal gap beside a proven one stays red with the code_fix\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ANTI-FALSE-GREEN: the USAA shape — a quarantined terminal gap with no size-vs-cap proof stays red\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"ANTI-FALSE-GREEN: unsupported/unavailable streams are unaffected by the unfillable flag\"}}\n\n==> test/rs-blobs-read-access-pure.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"executeBlobsRead: a missing blob is a not-found\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"executeBlobsRead: returns the blob when a visible record for the actor references it\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"executeBlobsRead: a binding for a DIFFERENT connector than the actor is skipped -> not found\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"executeBlobsRead: a visible record that references a DIFFERENT blob does not grant access\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"executeBlobsRead: no actor connector -> not found (cannot match any binding)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"executeBlobsRead: a getVisibleRecord throw is swallowed; a LATER matching binding still grants\"}}\n\n==> test/rs-blobs-read-boundary.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read operation has no host or storage concretes\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read operation does not import server/index.js\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read operation does not import server/records.js\"}}\n\n==> test/rs-blobs-read-operation.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read returns the blob row when a visible record references it\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read raises blob_not_found when the blob row is absent\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read raises blob_not_found when no binding matches the actor connector\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read raises blob_not_found when the actor has no resolved connector binding\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read raises blob_not_found when no visible record references this blob\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read raises blob_not_found when getVisibleRecord returns null\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read swallows per-binding errors and continues with other bindings\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.read skips bindings whose connector does not match the actor\"}}\n\n==> test/rs-blobs-upload-boundary.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload operation has no host or storage concretes\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload operation does not import server/index.js\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload operation does not import server/records.js\"}}\n\n==> test/rs-blobs-upload-groupme-attachments-manifest.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"GroupMe manifest declares an 'attachments' stream (matches gmail/whatsapp/imessage convention)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"POST /v1/blobs?stream=attachments&record_key=attachment:image succeeds against the real GroupMe manifest\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"sanity: an undeclared stream still 404s (proves the check is real, not vacuously true)\"}}\n\n==> test/rs-blobs-upload-operation.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload returns the canonical { object: \\\"blob\\\", ... } envelope\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload rejects missing connector_id with invalid_request\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload rejects whitespace-only stream with invalid_request\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload rejects missing Content-Type header\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload rejects malformed Content-Type\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload normalizes Content-Type by stripping parameters and lowercasing\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload uses declared blob MIME type independently of transport Content-Type\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"rs.blobs.upload throws not_