jects captured import file without credential semantics\"}}\n\n==> test/stderr-redact-identity.test.ts\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"an unlabelled registered credential is redacted (the defect)\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"redaction preserves diagnostic value: the line still shows a credential APPEARED\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a registered credential is redacted at every occurrence, mid-word included\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"the labelled form still redacts — shape rules are kept, not replaced\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"an UNREGISTERED secret still gets shape-based treatment where a rule applies\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a non-secret string of similar shape is NOT redacted\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a secret shorter than the 4-character floor is NOT matched by identity\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a longer secret is redacted before a shorter secret contained inside it\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"a credential containing regex metacharacters is matched literally\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"identity runs BEFORE the shape rules, so a secret straddling a rewrite is not split\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"details\":{\"type\":\"test\",\"name\":\"identity outranks the declared-reason-token allowlist\"}}\nPDPP_TEST_ACCOUNTING_EVENT {\"type\":\"test:pass\",\"de